00:06:30.711 --> 00:06:34.744
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:06:35.343 --> 00:06:42.615
<v Slow>悠仁さまは、9月6日に、何歳になりましたか。

00:06:43.415 --> 00:06:45.744
<v Host>He turned twenty years old.

00:06:46.343 --> 00:06:53.375
<v Slow>悠仁さまは、大学で、何を勉強していますか。

00:06:54.175 --> 00:06:58.208
<v Host>He mainly studies biology, at the University of Tsukuba.

00:06:58.807 --> 00:07:04.615
<v Slow>悠仁さまは、どんな虫が大好きですか。

00:07:05.415 --> 00:07:09.184
<v Host>Dragonflies — he has loved them since he was a child.

00:07:09.783 --> 00:07:21.399
<v Host>That's all for today. From dragonflies to old maps, Prince Hisahito is a curious student — and now, at twenty, a new chapter begins. See you next time!

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.399
<v News>また明日。
